  <section class="page-intro wrap">
    <h1>Enterprise delivery.<br/>Practical AI workflows.</h1>
    <p class="lead">I’m Dave Bettner, based in Des Moines. I lead enterprise software implementations and build tools and AI workflows for finance and reporting teams.</p>
  </section>
